# Build-context hygiene for deploy/Dockerfile.* (build context = repo root).
# Excludes anything the image rebuilds or must never contain, while keeping the
# workspace sources the Dockerfiles COPY (manifests, app sources, prisma schema,
# patches, and the runtime product-knowledge the AI loads).

# Dependencies & build outputs — reinstalled / rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/web/.expo
apps/web/web-build
coverage

# VCS / CI / logs
.git
.github
*.log

# Secrets & local env — never bake into an image
.env
.env.*
deploy/.env

# Local-only spec docs — but KEEP the runtime product-knowledge the AI reads
docs
!docs/product-knowledge
!docs/product-knowledge/**
